  "body": "## Changelog\n* b3004d1bdae239859b5d6a87672b3accc5ebc568 Site: regenerate the shape goldens for the 24px body text\n* a1c0ed0618e0e764f8bbf35592ac26ff6c9dba3e Site: show logo in README title\n* 6148306d7644c066883d832a5af0ebd4d3ed4436 Docs: streamline the introduction of the README\n* b4e8e4b97d193c100e778c1fad7e2c1a45ef1a9f Site: set the body text to 24px\n* 6e5852a2e10642cd953abbbdc34759dc388615c4 Site: keep no chip-row space on a card with no type glyph\n* 95acce7659f91c90ebe93566beacb19b353a31f2 Site: compare the tag, not the body, in the notifier poll test\n* 0cba5f81125e00592983e414309b82fd1c317bc4 Review: give the workspace sync test its own origin URL\n* 14241e800a0944c986d693b13b97b8ae5bfef530 Click: bring Ghostty to the front after the tab is selected\n* 6235d6f9ac5e8a37cd4524958917153849359c17 Notifications: give each message a title and a body from its item\n* bec004b32e8f7b4fff0e69d3e63176f95410077b Settings: show the notification level of the workspace in the TUI\n* 64fe0b33b89699d08c81c258ee68ed4dbb523eb4 Notifications: give each repository a level of all, default or off\n* f808a469838e655d049b2ec0b7db567a10503a38 Timeline: show an assign or a review request as an action\n* fca3c448432cee2de544ca25a0fabc46da75d0d6 Docs: assess the app for the notarization check\n\n"
